OL,3,GNEWSAMajor oil and gas firm EnQuest
OL,4,Apulls out of the North Sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the UK's biggest oil and gas
OL,7,Fproducers is withdrawing from the North
OL,8,FSea to shift its focus to south-east
OL,9,FAsia.
OL,11,FEnQuest said it had agreed to sell its
OL,12,FUK exploration and production business
OL,13,Fto Aberdeen-headquartered Neo Next+ for
OL,14,Fup to #729m.
OL,16,FIt comes after BP put its North Sea
OL,17,Fassets up for sale in the summer after
OL,18,F60 years of production, and other firms
OL,19,Fhave either sold, merged or reduced
OL,20,Factivity.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
