OL,3,GNEWSAMajor oil and gas firm EnQuest
OL,4,Apulls out of the North Sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnQuest said its decision followed
OL,7,Funcertainty over investment and tax
OL,8,Frises in recent years. The UK
OL,9,Fgovernment said the North Sea remained
OL,10,Fto be a "vital national asset".
